  "body": "Step inside and discover a home designed for modern lifestyles, where comfort, style and functionality come together effortlessly. Thoughtfully configured across two levels, the home offers one bedroom on the ground floor, ideal for guests, extended family, or those seeking added convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs features three generous bedrooms, including the master suite, along with a separate family lounge, creating the perfect retreat for relaxation, children's activities, or working from home. This flexible layout provides ample space for growing families and multi-generational living.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan living and dining areas create a welcoming space for everyday family life and entertaining alike, while the contemporary kitchen serves as the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the ease of low-maintenance living in one of Silverdale's most desirable neighbourhoods. With Silverdale Shopping Centre, Orewa Beach, local cafés, parks and quality schools all nearby, you'll have everything you need within easy reach. Excellent motorway access and the nearby Park & Ride make commuting to the CBD simple and convenient.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for a family home, looking for extra space, or seeking a smart investment opportunity, this property offers the perfect combination of lifestyle, flexibility and location.\r\n\r\nContact Sherlock today for more information or to arrange your private viewing.",
